																								<script type="text/javascript">
							var StoreDefaults = {"PartnerEventStore":[{"gid":"683017363938870304","clan_steamid":"103582791475803226","event_name":"Daydream Cat: DreamSpirits Idle Adventure \u2014 Full Release Now Available!","event_type":10,"appid":5147000,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1793272020,"rtime32_end_time":1793277001,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"The full game is out now. Set off with your Dreamspirits and carry over your Demo progress!\",\"Die Vollversion ist da! Zieht mit euren Traumgeistern los und \u00fcbernehmt euren Demo-Fortschritt.\",\"Le jeu complet est disponible ! Partez avec vos Esprits oniriques et conservez votre progression de la d\u00e9mo.\",null,\"\uc815\uc2dd \ubc84\uc804 \ucd9c\uc2dc! \uafc8\ub839\ub4e4\uacfc \uc0c8\ub85c\uc6b4 \uc6d0\uc815\uc744 \ub5a0\ub098\uc138\uc694. Demo \uc9c4\ud589 \uc0c1\ud669\ub3c4 \uc774\uc5b4\uac08 \uc218 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\",\"\u00a1La versi\u00f3n completa ya est\u00e1 disponible! Parte con tus Esp\u00edritus on\u00edricos y conserva tu progreso de la demo.\",\"\u6b63\u5f0f\u7248\u73b0\u5df2\u53d1\u884c\uff0c\u5e26\u4e0a\u4f60\u7684\u68a6\u7075\uff0c\u8e0f\u4e0a\u65b0\u7684\u8fdc\u5f81\uff01Demo \u8fdb\u5ea6\u53ef\u7ee7\u627f\u3002\",\"\u6b63\u5f0f\u7248\u73fe\u5df2\u767c\u884c\uff0c\u5e36\u4e0a\u4f60\u7684\u5922\u9748\uff0c\u8e0f\u4e0a\u65b0\u7684\u9060\u5f81\uff01Demo \u9032\u5ea6\u53ef\u7e7c\u627f\u3002\",\"\u041f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u0430\u044f \u0432\u0435\u0440\u0441\u0438\u044f \u0443\u0436\u0435 \u0434\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0443\u043f\u043d\u0430! \u041e\u0442\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043b\u044f\u0439\u0442\u0435\u0441\u044c \u0441 \u0414\u0443\u0445\u0430\u043c\u0438 \u0441\u043d\u043e\u0432\u0438\u0434\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u0432 \u043f\u0443\u0442\u044c, \u0441\u043e\u0445\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0432 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0433\u0440\u0435\u0441\u0441 \u0434\u0435\u043c\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0441\u0438\u0438.\",\"\u0e40\u0e27\u0e2d\u0e23\u0e4c\u0e0a\u0e31\u0e19\u0e40\u0e15\u0e47\u0e21\u0e21\u0e32\u0e41\u0e25\u0e49\u0e27! \u0e2d\u0e2d\u0e01\u0e40\u0e14\u0e34\u0e19\u0e17\u0e32\u0e07\u0e01\u0e31\u0e1a\u0e27\u0e34\u0e0d\u0e0d\u0e32\u0e13\u0e1d\u0e31\u0e19 \u0e41\u0e25\u0e30\u0e19\u0e33\u0e04\u0e27\u0e32\u0e21\u0e04\u0e37\u0e1a\u0e2b\u0e19\u0e49\u0e32\u0e08\u0e32\u0e01 Demo \u0e44\u0e1b\u0e15\u0e48\u0e2d\u0e44\u0e14\u0e49\",\"\u6b63\u5f0f\u7248\u304c\u914d\u4fe1\u958b\u59cb\uff01\u5922\u970a\u305f\u3061\u3068\u65b0\u305f\u306a\u9060\u5f81\u3078\u3002Demo\u306e\u9032\u884c\u72b6\u6cc1\u3082\u5f15\u304d\u7d99\u3052\u307e\u3059\u3002\",null,\"Pe\u0142na wersja ju\u017c dost\u0119pna! Wyrusz z Duchami snu i zachowaj post\u0119py z dema.\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"Tam s\u00fcr\u00fcm \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131! D\u00fc\u015f Ruhlar\u0131nla yeni sefere \u00e7\u0131k, Demo ilerlemeni yan\u0131nda g\u00f6t\u00fcr.\",\"A vers\u00e3o completa j\u00e1 est\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel! Parta com seus Esp\u00edritos on\u00edricos e mantenha o progresso da Demo.\",null,null,null,\"\u041f\u043e\u0432\u043d\u0430 \u0432\u0435\u0440\u0441\u0456\u044f \u0432\u0436\u0435 \u0434\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0443\u043f\u043d\u0430! \u0412\u0438\u0440\u0443\u0448\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0437 \u0414\u0443\u0445\u0430\u043c\u0438 \u0441\u043d\u043e\u0432\u0438\u0434\u0456\u043d\u044c \u0443 \u043f\u043e\u0434\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0436, \u0437\u0431\u0435\u0440\u0456\u0433\u0448\u0438 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0433\u0440\u0435\u0441 \u0434\u0435\u043c\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0441\u0456\u0457.\",\"\u00a1La versi\u00f3n completa ya est\u00e1 disponible! Parte con tus Esp\u00edritus on\u00edricos y conserva tu progreso de la demo.\",\"B\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111\u00e3 ra m\u1eaft! \u0110\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng M\u1ed9ng Linh v\u00e0 ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c ti\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ed9 Demo c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.\",null,\"Versi lengkap telah rilis! Berekspedisi bersama Roh Mimpi dan lanjutkan progres Demo kalian.\",null],\"localized_summary\":[\"The full game is now available! Collect and raise Dreamspirits, challenge Savage Realm, and read the equipment, interface, combat, and fix details below.\",\"Die Vollversion ist da! Sammelt und trainiert Traumgeister, stellt euch dem Savage-Reich und entdeckt unten die Neuerungen und Fehlerbehebungen.\",\"Le jeu complet est disponible ! Collectionnez et \u00e9levez vos Esprits oniriques, d\u00e9fiez le Royaume Savage et d\u00e9couvrez ci-dessous les nouveaut\u00e9s et corrections.\",null,\"\uc815\uc2dd \ubc84\uc804\uc774 \ucd9c\uc2dc\ub418\uc5c8\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4! \uafc8\ub839\uc744 \uc218\uc9d1\ud558\uace0 \uc721\uc131\ud558\uba70 Savage \ube44\uacbd\uc5d0 \ub3c4\uc804\ud558\uc138\uc694. \uc7a5\ube44\u00b7\ud654\uba74\u00b7\uc804\ud22c \uc5c5\ub370\uc774\ud2b8\uc640 \uc218\uc815 \uc0ac\ud56d\uc740 \uc544\ub798\uc5d0\uc11c \ud655\uc778\ud558\uc138\uc694.\",\"\u00a1La versi\u00f3n completa ya est\u00e1 disponible! Colecciona y cr\u00eda Esp\u00edritus on\u00edricos, desaf\u00eda el Reino Savage y consulta las novedades y correcciones m\u00e1s abajo.\",\"\u6b63\u5f0f\u7248\u73b0\u5df2\u53d1\u884c\uff01\u6536\u96c6\u3001\u57f9\u517b\u68a6\u7075\uff0c\u6311\u6218\u96f6\u5f0f\u79d8\u5883\u3002\u4e0b\u9644\u672c\u6b21\u88c5\u5907\u3001\u754c\u9762\u3001\u6218\u6597\u4e0e\u4fee\u590d\u66f4\u65b0\u3002\",\"\u6b63\u5f0f\u7248\u73fe\u5df2\u767c\u884c\uff01\u6536\u96c6\u3001\u57f9\u990a\u5922\u9748\uff0c\u6311\u6230\u96f6\u5f0f\u79d8\u5883\u3002\u4e0b\u9644\u672c\u6b21\u88dd\u5099\u3001\u4ecb\u9762\u3001\u6230\u9b25\u8207\u4fee\u6b63\u66f4\u65b0\u3002\",\"\u041f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u0430\u044f \u0432\u0435\u0440\u0441\u0438\u044f \u0443\u0436\u0435 \u0432\u044b\u0448\u043b\u0430! \u0421\u043e\u0431\u0438\u0440\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0438 \u0440\u0430\u0437\u0432\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0414\u0443\u0445\u043e\u0432 \u0441\u043d\u043e\u0432\u0438\u0434\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0439, \u0438\u0441\u043f\u044b\u0442\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0426\u0430\u0440\u0441\u0442\u0432\u043e Savage \u0438 \u0443\u0437\u043d\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u043e \u043d\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0432\u0432\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f\u0445 \u0438 \u0438\u0441\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f\u0445 \u043d\u0438\u0436\u0435.\",\"\u0e40\u0e27\u0e2d\u0e23\u0e4c\u0e0a\u0e31\u0e19\u0e40\u0e15\u0e47\u0e21\u0e27\u0e32\u0e07\u0e08\u0e33\u0e2b\u0e19\u0e48\u0e32\u0e22\u0e41\u0e25\u0e49\u0e27! \u0e2a\u0e30\u0e2a\u0e21\u0e41\u0e25\u0e30\u0e40\u0e25\u0e35\u0e49\u0e22\u0e07\u0e14\u0e39\u0e27\u0e34\u0e0d\u0e0d\u0e32\u0e13\u0e1d\u0e31\u0e19 \u0e17\u0e49\u0e32\u0e17\u0e32\u0e22\u0e41\u0e14\u0e19\u0e25\u0e31\u0e1a Savage \u0e41\u0e25\u0e30\u0e2d\u0e48\u0e32\u0e19\u0e40\u0e19\u0e37\u0e49\u0e2d\u0e2b\u0e32\u0e2d\u0e31\u0e1b\u0e40\u0e14\u0e15\u0e01\u0e31\u0e1a\u0e01\u0e32\u0e23\u0e41\u0e01\u0e49\u0e44\u0e02\u0e14\u0e49\u0e32\u0e19\u0e25\u0e48\u0e32\u0e07\",\"\u6b63\u5f0f\u7248\u304c\u914d\u4fe1\u958b\u59cb\uff01\u5922\u970a\u3092\u96c6\u3081\u3066\u80b2\u3066\u3001\u96f6\u5f0f\u79d8\u5883\u306b\u6311\u3082\u3046\u3002\u88c5\u5099\u30fb\u753b\u9762\u30fb\u6226\u95d8\u306e\u66f4\u65b0\u5185\u5bb9\u3068\u4e0d\u5177\u5408\u4fee\u6b63\u306f\u4e0b\u8a18\u3092\u3054\u89a7\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002\",null,\"Pe\u0142na wersja ju\u017c dost\u0119pna! Zbieraj i rozwijaj Duchy snu, podejmij wyzwania Krainy Savage i poznaj poni\u017csze nowo\u015bci oraz poprawki.\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"Tam s\u00fcr\u00fcm \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131! D\u00fc\u015f Ruhlar\u0131n\u0131 topla ve geli\u015ftir, Savage Diyar\u0131\u2019na meydan oku. Yenilikler ve d\u00fczeltmeler a\u015fa\u011f\u0131da.\",\"A vers\u00e3o completa chegou! Colecione e crie Esp\u00edritos on\u00edricos, enfrente o Reino Savage e confira abaixo as novidades e corre\u00e7\u00f5es.\",null,null,null,\"\u041f\u043e\u0432\u043d\u0430 \u0432\u0435\u0440\u0441\u0456\u044f \u0432\u0436\u0435 \u0432\u0438\u0439\u0448\u043b\u0430! \u0417\u0431\u0438\u0440\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0439 \u0440\u043e\u0437\u0432\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0414\u0443\u0445\u0456\u0432 \u0441\u043d\u043e\u0432\u0438\u0434\u0456\u043d\u044c, \u0432\u0438\u043f\u0440\u043e\u0431\u0443\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0426\u0430\u0440\u0441\u0442\u0432\u043e Savage \u0442\u0430 \u0434\u0456\u0437\u043d\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435\u0441\u044f \u043f\u0440\u043e \u043d\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0432\u0432\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044f \u0439 \u0432\u0438\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044f \u043d\u0438\u0436\u0447\u0435.\",\"\u00a1La versi\u00f3n completa ya est\u00e1 disponible! Colecciona y cr\u00eda Esp\u00edritus on\u00edricos, desaf\u00eda el Reino Savage y consulta las novedades y correcciones m\u00e1s abajo.\",\"B\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 m\u1eb7t! Thu th\u1eadp, nu\u00f4i d\u01b0\u1ee1ng M\u1ed9ng Linh, th\u1eed s\u1ee9c \u1edf B\u00ed C\u1ea3nh Savage v\u00e0 xem c\u00e1c n\u1ed9i dung c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt, s\u1eeda l\u1ed7i b\u00ean d\u01b0\u1edbi.\",null,\"Versi lengkap telah tersedia! Kumpulkan dan kembangkan Roh Mimpi, tantang Alam Savage, lalu simak pembaruan dan perbaikan di bawah.\",null],\"localized_title_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,\"129864cc9ad08e9c65d07da8ecd08658e6eca2af.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"95ffe719f21ad8d8fa6e9281179b8b64434f7471.png\",null,null,null,null,null,\"383e9e8dd61839a640e8b2616fdd2cd9c3d94087.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[]}","announcement_body":{"gid":"683017363938870305","clanid":"46281818","posterid":"0","headline":"Daydream Cat: DreamSpirits Idle Adventure \u2014 Full Release Now Available!","posttime":1793272048,"updatetime":1793272048,"body":"Thank you for playing, sharing feedback, and joining us through the Demo and Playtest. The full version of Daydream Cat: DreamSpirits Idle Adventure is now available on Steam!\n\nCollect your favorite Dreamspirits, hatch eggs, raise your team, and combine skills, keywords, and equipment as you set off on a new expedition together. The full game opens up later progression and challenges, including Savage Realm, plus repeat crafting and fusion unlocked through their corresponding talents.\n\n[b]You can carry your Demo progress into the full game without starting over. This update also preserves your existing saves.[\/b]\n\nThank you to everyone who offered suggestions, reported issues, and helped the game grow. We hope you and your Dreamspirits enjoy the journey ahead!\n\n[h2]What's in This Update[\/h2]\n\n[b]Savage Realm and Equipment[\/b]\n[list]\n[*]Unlock Savage Realm in the workshop at player level 90 in the full game. The weapon, armor, and hands\/feet trials each have an exclusive team of up to 3 Dreamspirits and produce independently. Assessments last up to 60 seconds. Scores affect only how quickly draws accumulate online, not reward quality or odds.\n[*]Enter each trial for the first time to receive one free draw. Each trial stores up to 20 draws. Draw once, ten times, or all at once, and skip animations if desired. Pending rewards remain when your bag is full, and reopening the panel does not reroll determined results. Savage production does not accumulate offline.\n[*]Added Savage equipment with randomized stat combinations, encyclopedia entries, a bag filter, and optional automatic locking. Automatic and repeat crafting exclude Savage equipment by default. Manually consuming it shows a warning about changes to its special properties. A full tutorial grants a real legendary Savage off-hand item once.\n[\/list]\n\n[b]Pixel Art and Controls[\/b]\n[list]\n[*]Added animated pixel objects to workshop operations. Crafting, fusion, and related actions validate inputs, consume materials, and deliver results when their animations finish. Savage Realm also gains three colored portals with opening and production animations.\n[*]Click an egg in your bag or storage to open the hatching page and insert that egg, then start hatching manually.\n[*]Main-story and trial maps now feature new pixel scenery, distinct continents and island chains, and environmental animation. Crisp native pixels are preserved, with improved vertical browsing, stage positioning, and long-name display.\n[*]The garrison panel now has a draggable, rotating dreamcatcher with 18 beads. Occupied nodes light up. Click a node to view its team, stage category, and effects.\n[*]Added an animated burner and companion to the incense page, and repositioned the remaining time and effect descriptions. Workshop, Savage Realm, garrison, and incense tutorials now match the updated layouts.\n[\/list]\n\n[b]Combat and Fixes[\/b]\n[list]\n[*]Raised the simultaneous summon cap by 1 for each of five summon types, independently per caster: Ancestral Pact now allows 3, and the other four types allow 2.\n[*]Increased HP growth toward the end of each Daydream band: the first stage is unchanged and the last has 20% more HP. Enemy HP at the final depth of the Riposte and Echo trials increased by 30% and 20%, respectively. Attack, time limits, and rewards are unchanged.\n[*]Fixed general talent bonuses being applied twice to offline coins, player experience, and Dreamspirit experience.\n[\/list]\n\nSavage Realm, repeat crafting and fusion, and late-game challenges are full-game content. Repeat operations require the corresponding talent. The Demo keeps its existing scope.\n\n[b]Thank you for your support. Your next expedition starts now![\/b]","commentcount":5,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_773020726_1793272743_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"573805072991046630","event_gid":"683017363938870304","voteupcount":15,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"573805072991046630","rtime32_last_modified":1793374235,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1793272743,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1793272033,"votes_up":15,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"585061900942058936","gidfeature2":"573805072991046630"},{"gid":"705532825431967978","clan_steamid":"103582791475803226","event_name":"Free Steam Demo Available Now!","event_type":31,"appid":5147000,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1791289320,"rtime32_end_time":1791293401,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"Build your team, hatch DreamSpirits, and carry your progress into the full game.\",null,null,null,null,null,\"\u7ec4\u5efa\u68a6\u7075\u5c0f\u961f\uff0c\u5b75\u5316\u5e76\u6536\u96c6\u68a6\u7075\uff0cDemo \u8fdb\u5ea6\u53ef\u7ee7\u627f\u81f3\u6b63\u5f0f\u7248\u3002\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[\"The free demo for Daydream Cat: DreamSpirits Idle Adventure is now available on Steam. Begin your desktop adventure today; the full game launches October 29.\",null,null,null,null,null,\"\u300a\u767d\u65e5\u68a6\u732b\uff1a\u68a6\u7075\u653e\u7f6e\u5192\u9669\u300b\u514d\u8d39 Demo \u73b0\u5df2\u5728 Steam \u63a8\u51fa\u3002\u7acb\u5373\u5f00\u59cb\u4f60\u7684\u684c\u9762\u5192\u9669\uff0c\u6b63\u5f0f\u7248\u5c06\u4e8e 10 \u6708 29 \u65e5\u53d1\u552e\u3002\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,\"e0edaf1ffb46b8a1499ebd54da30d8019929837c.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"9096cc7bd888d2abec118713155f40357960fccf.png\",null,null,null,null,null,\"707fc7ffca7a084413803c1c54e2befac113b17d.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[]}","announcement_body":{"gid":"705532825431967979","clanid":"46281818","posterid":"0","headline":"Free Steam Demo Available Now!","posttime":1791289334,"updatetime":1791289334,"body":"[p][\/p][p]The free Steam demo for Daydream Cat: DreamSpirits Idle Adventure is available now![\/p][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46281818\/811000686e2cd68783e876182f82bf0bdecb9f7f.gif\"][\/img][\/p][p]Build a team of DreamSpirits and let them continue adventuring beside your desktop while you work, study, or watch videos.[\/p][p]In the demo, you can:[\/p][p]\u2022 Build and customize your DreamSpirit team\n\u2022 Hatch and collect new DreamSpirits\n\u2022 Experience the early progression of the adventure\n\u2022 Carry your demo progress over to the full game[\/p][p]The full game launches on October 29, 2026.[\/p][p]Download the free demo and begin your adventure today:[\/p][p][\/p][p][dynamiclink href=\"https:\/\/store.steampowered.com\/app\/5147000\/\"][\/dynamiclink][\/p][p]If you encounter a problem or would like to share feedback, please visit the Steam Discussions or join our Discord community:[\/p][p][url=\"https:\/\/discord.gg\/UERx2Ztwae\"]https:\/\/discord.gg\/UERx2Ztwae[\/url][\/p]","commentcount":2,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1434278705_1791290109_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"585061900942058937","event_gid":"705532825431967978","voteupcount":3,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"585061900942058937","rtime32_last_modified":1793075152,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1791290109,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1791289272,"votes_up":3,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"585061900942058936","gidfeature2":"585061900942058937"},{"gid":"683017363938871449","clan_steamid":"103582791475803226","event_name":"Warehouse Search, Death Logs and UI Improvements","event_type":12,"appid":5147000,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1793366752,"rtime32_end_time":0,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"[]","announcement_body":{"gid":"683017363938871450","clanid":"46281818","posterid":"0","headline":"Warehouse Search, Death Logs and UI Improvements","posttime":1793366752,"updatetime":1793366752,"body":"[list]\n[*]Added warehouse search with combined filters for Dreamspirits, items and equipment, including innate affix filters for Dreamspirits. Matches appear first. Exiting search clears the filters and restores the original slot layout.\n[*]Added Dreamspirit death logs showing the fatal damage source, skill or basic attack, physical\/elemental\/chaos category, and the damage of the individual hit that caused death.\n[*]Added 75% and 125% UI scaling. These settings automatically use the Smooth font style. Switching to another scale restores your saved font preference, with a safe fallback when the screen has insufficient space.\n[*]Fixed kill and healing interactions. Kills caused by counterattacks, detonations and similar effects now correctly trigger Killer Instinct and Grace. Healing from Grace can trigger related healing effects. Also fixed duplicate death resolution and follow-up effects targeting defeated units.\n[*]Fixed the hits-taken counter and copied effect resolution for Retribution, ensuring correct support for Echo and Multicast.\n[*]Adjusted summon visuals to prioritize keeping melee, ranged and healing summons clear of their summoner. Logical positions, range and combat values are unchanged.\n[*]Corrected skill descriptions for stat conversions, skill power, shield enhancement, affected targets, hits taken, multiplier precision and minus signs, with corresponding localization updates.\n[*]Codex previews now use a fixed neutral nature so the same skill's preview description no longer changes randomly.\n[\/list]","commentcount":0,"tags":["patchnotes","mod_reviewed","ModAct_1607812438_1793369098_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"573805072991173395","event_gid":"683017363938871449","voteupcount":5,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"573805072991173395","rtime32_last_modified":1793402438,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1793369098,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1793366752,"votes_up":5,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"585061900942058936","gidfeature2":"573805072991173395"}],"EventWebRowEmbed":{"bPreLoaded":true,"announcementGIDList":["683017363938870305","705532825431967979"],"last_update_event":{"rtime":1793366752,"event_gid":"683017363938871449","announcement_gid":"683017363938871450","clan_account_id":46281818}}};
