								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<h2 class="bb_tag" >· The Adventure Never Stops</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><i>Daydream Cat: DreamSpirits Idle Adventure</i> is a desktop idle RPG built around three-member teams, collecting, progression, and automatic combat.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Let your Dreamspirits keep adventuring in a corner of your desktop. Focus on work, browse the web, or watch a video, then return to make the decisions that matter: adjust your lineup, equip new gear, unlock talents, and send the journey onward.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>The demo launches on October 6—your progress will carry over to the full game.</strong></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147000/extras/1b7e166bf7b288539071b171c5991ec4.poster.avif?t=1793271766" aria-label="Lyra runs, attacks, takes a hit, and returns to an idle pose beside two Dream Eggs." width=1170 height=300 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147000/extras/1b7e166bf7b288539071b171c5991ec4.webm?t=1793271766" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147000/extras/1b7e166bf7b288539071b171c5991ec4.mp4?t=1793271766" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >· Three Dreamspirits, Countless Combinations</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Choose three members from 451 collectible Dreamspirits and build a team of your own.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Roles, races, elements, skills, innate affixes, and synergies all interact. Protect your main damage dealer, combine skill effects, or build an entire lineup around a favorite Dreamspirit—every adjustment can take your team farther.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147000/extras/cd5405cd4c49b2ebddafe98760d0e0ad.poster.avif?t=1793271766" aria-label="Lyra and three starter Dreamspirits demonstrate their attack animations on a rocky battlefield." width=1170 height=300 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147000/extras/cd5405cd4c49b2ebddafe98760d0e0ad.webm?t=1793271766" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147000/extras/cd5405cd4c49b2ebddafe98760d0e0ad.mp4?t=1793271766" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >· Step Away. The Battle Continues.</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Your team automatically fights enemies, uses skills, and advances through stages. Even while you are away, it continues earning offline rewards.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >There is no need to click endlessly. Decide how to develop your members, allocate resources, and refine your setup. Leave the fighting to your Dreamspirits and keep your time for yourself.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >· A Collection Begins with a Dream Egg</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Find Dream Eggs, hatch new companions, and discover Dreamspirits of different rarities—including rare Shiny variants.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Use fusion and evolution to raise the members you love, expand your Codex, and find the missing piece for your next team.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147000/extras/c672d63c6cf18c598012cda4d102617b.poster.avif?t=1793271766" aria-label="Three elemental Dream Eggs hatch one after another into starter Dreamspirits while Lyra watches." width=1170 height=300 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147000/extras/c672d63c6cf18c598012cda4d102617b.webm?t=1793271766" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147000/extras/c672d63c6cf18c598012cda4d102617b.mp4?t=1793271766" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >· Grow Through Equipment, Crafting, and Talents</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Defeated enemies drop equipment, materials, and loot chests. Enhance equipment, socket bonuses, craft resources in the workshop, and plan your path through 132 talent nodes covering combat, collection, economy, and idle progression.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Every reward and every choice changes where your team goes next.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147000/extras/a08239a053a7402598d1b922597b61d8.poster.avif?t=1793271766" aria-label="Three starter Dreamspirits evolve into their final forms and perform powerful attacks." width=1170 height=300 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147000/extras/a08239a053a7402598d1b922597b61d8.webm?t=1793271766" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147000/extras/a08239a053a7402598d1b922597b61d8.mp4?t=1793271766" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >· Journey Deeper into the Dream</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Challenge 5 map floors, 4 difficulty levels, and 200 stage combinations. Hunt for better equipment, hatch rarer Dreamspirits, and keep perfecting your three-member team.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Build your team. Adventure automatically. Keep dreaming.</strong></p>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
			<h2>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2>
			<p>The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
					No generative AI was used to create the game's visual art or artwork. Generative AI was used to create the initial versions of some music tracks, which were then manually edited and adapted into loopable versions for use in the game. AI was also used to assist with drafting and editing some store page descriptions.				</i>
			</p>
					</div>
	</div>
	
				
				
